bility drift; pm-todos can migrate away from spawning pm without private imports; SDK and extension docs describe the lifecycle and compatibility contract"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"project management = context management"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Every extension execution surface receives composable in-process PM primitives from the public SDK"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Package authors can build portable import/export integrations without subprocess coupling"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"GitHub issue #749 reports a real downstream pm-todos blocker after the SDK-first baseline landed"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-usfg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Importer/exporter handlers receive a typed host-bound SDK and can execute supported PM actions in process."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Command handlers receive sdk, but ImportExportContext does not, so importer/exporter handlers must spawn pm or cannot reuse the public runtime."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-13bn","kind":"incident_from","created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z"},{"id":"pm-1p2u","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z"},{"id":"pm-7qjk","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z"},{"id":"pm-te6elw","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z"},{"id":"pm-xzhz","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"GitHub report linkage: GH-749 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/749. Created only after an all-status duplicate search and full metadata review of the closest SDK/importer/exporter lineage."}]}],"before_hash":"3c